{"synopsis":"Shin Yoomyeong adalah aktor tak dikenal yang terus mengejar mimpinya meski memainkan peran kecil selama 15 tahun karena kehadirannya yang lemah\nSuatu hari dia bertemu dengan Roh Akting Yeonghwi yang menandatangani kontrak dengannya dan mulai bersinar dalam karirnya\nFaktanya dia selalu jenius dalam akting tapi dia dibayangi oleh kehadirannya yang lemah\nDia menciptakan karakter yang sempurna untuk setiap pekerjaan yang dia lakukan dan perlahanlahan menjadi bintang\nNamun Yeonghwi yang dia anggap sebagai dermawannya mulai terlihat mencurigakan","alternative_title":"천재 배우의 아우라","author":"Geulsulsul, Gimae","artist":"Gamcha","chapters":[{"number":"85","chapter":"85","slug":"e24860c8-6508-4f26-a07a-a86cba422c6f","title":"Chapter 85","date":"2025-04-27"},{"number":"84","chapter":"84","slug":"80680f0a-766c-4729-a723-84a854f3e154","title":"Chapter 84","date":"2025-04-20"},{"number":"83","chapter":"83","slug":"5baca8c0-5b91-4d09-87cf-32241e129fb3","title":"Chapter 83","date":"2025-04-13"},{"number":"82","chapter":"82","slug":"1a0ea49f-7277-4d0f-9b4b-0ede0d32fc2d","title":"Chapter 82","date":"2025-04-04"},{"number":"81","chapter":"81","slug":"9c1450aa-edff-4f54-922a-812c34250804","title":"Chapter 81","date":"2025-03-29"},{"number":"80","chapter":"80","slug":"a73f8a2c-2469-47c2-bce8-76007db5e8cd","title":"Chapter 80","date":"2025-03-24"},{"number":"79","chapter":"79","slug":"f4ef74ad-20fc-48c8-8a36-b21e886d6b0f","title":"Chapter 79","date":"2025-03-23"},{"number":"78","chapter":"78","slug":"388e5817-a82e-4eb1-9207-8530b753964e","title":"Chapter 78","date":"2025-03-23"},{"number":"77","chapter":"77","slug":"47bc8b67-b751-418c-a60a-91eafa25cf50","title":"Chapter 77","date":"2025-03-10"},{"number":"76","chapter":"76","slug":"08576892-8c5a-4f15-820f-890db6961a7b","title":"Chapter 76","date":"2025-03-10"},{"number":"75","chapter":"75","slug":"0082d8c5-6954-4737-9086-9cc33f7625ed","title":"Chapter 75","date":"2025-03-04"},{"number":"74","chapter":"74","slug":"2513fd67